WEBVTT

00:00:00.467 --> 00:00:01.207
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.092 --> 00:00:03.793
<v><b>F:</b></v> Did you park in the garage?

00:00:03.827 --> 00:00:06.860
<v><b>M:</b></v> No, I parked outside.

00:00:08.860 --> 00:00:09.608
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:10.668 --> 00:00:12.330
<v><b>M:</b></v> Are you going to have your hair cut?

00:00:12.602 --> 00:00:15.484
<v><b>F:</b></v> No, I’m going to have highlights done.

00:00:17.493 --> 00:00:18.383
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:19.077 --> 00:00:22.538
<v><b>A:</b></v> What an adorable baby! How old is he?

00:00:22.665 --> 00:00:26.624
<v><b>B:</b></v> How old is she, actually. She’s six weeks tomorrow.

00:00:28.563 --> 00:00:29.357
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:30.244 --> 00:00:32.287
<v><b>A:</b></v> Could you get some milk when you’re at the supermarket?

00:00:32.588 --> 00:00:35.788
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’m going to the bank. But I’ll try and pick some up on the way back.

00:00:37.807 --> 00:00:38.675
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:39.475 --> 00:00:42.920
<v><b>A:</b></v> Is that your niece, the one who’s studying sociology?

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:47.246
<v><b>B:</b></v> She’s teaching it now actually. She finished uni last year.